     RM0383 for STM32F411xC/E MCUs and RM0401 for STM32F410xx MCUs
     RM0090 for STM32F4X5xx/STM32F4X7xx/STM32F429xx/STM32F439xx MCUs
     RM0390 for STM32F446xx MCUs and RM0386 for STM32F469xx/STM32F479xx MCUs)).

